Value Required LOCAL_PORT (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value Required PORT (\S+)
Value SYSTEM (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Local Interface\s*:\s*${LOCAL_PORT}\s*$$ -> Neighbor

Neighbor
  ^\s*Management (?:address|Info)\b.*$$ -> Management
  ^\s*Local Interface\s*:\s*(\S+)\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*Local Interface\s*:\s*${LOCAL_PORT}\s*$$
  ^\s*Chassis (?:ID|Id)\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^\s*Port ID\s*:\s*${PORT}\s*$$
  ^\s*System name\s*:\s*${SYSTEM}\s*$$

Management
  ^\s*Local Interface\s*:\s*(\S+)\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*Local Interface\s*:\s*${LOCAL_PORT}\s*$$ -> Neighbor
